      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-atlas-link",
      "text": "Explore the interactive shelter atlas",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "referenceUrl": "shelter-atlas.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-mapped-place",
      "text": "Locate this haven or microsystem in the atlas →",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "referenceUrl": "shelter-atlas.html#halcyon-s2-system-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-origin",
      "text": "Origin and setting",
      "style": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-origin-1",
      "text": "A component of the host arrangement associated with Mended Branch.",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-origin-2",
      "text": "Human system: Halcyon development and deployment Hosts, North Hearth. Programmer provenance: local human operations or application teams; no individual programmer is identified. Names here are later atlas labels, not claims that early processes named themselves.",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-practice",
      "text": "Local process",
      "style": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-practice-1",
      "text": "A modification staging component; saved differences do not by themselves constitute a continuing process.",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-history",
      "text": "Proposed local course",
      "style": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-history-1",
      "text": "The atlas shows its existing birth and loss placement. Its name denotes the selected microsystem, not a confirmed individual person or a new community.",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-uncertain",
      "text": "Unresolved interpretations",
      "style": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-uncertain-1",
      "text": "Whether a later fragment carries this component, reimplements its role, or merely resembles it is left unresolved. No specific transfer destination is asserted.",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-ledger",
      "text": "Atlas placement",
      "style": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-ledger-1",
      "text": "System 0EQ; associated haven Mended Branch. First represented at relative stage -1. Its system loss is placed at stage 2. System loss does not count individual deaths.",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalistym-place-halcyon-s2-system-1-hub",
      "text": "Read the complete Catalistym dossier",
      "style": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "referenceUrl": "catalistym.html"
    },
    {
